  },
  "description": "Find MCP - the npm client for the agentage MCP directory: thin stdio MCP proxy bridging stdio-only clients (Claude Desktop, Cursor, VS Code) to catalog.agentage.io/mcp - search 17,000+ MCP servers from any MCP client.",
  "dist-tags": {
